    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Creating Columns"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In a grid layout, elements are positioned using rows and columns."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You can define the total number of columns with their widths using the grid-template-columns property."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Consider the code below:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<div class=\"container\">\n2    <div class=\"item-1\"></div>\n3    <div class=\"item-2\"></div>\n4    <div class=\"item-3\"></div>\n5<div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1.container {\n2    /* Customize column sizes */\n3    grid-template-columns: 200px 100px 50px;\n4    height: 150px;\n5\n6    display: grid;\n7}\n8\n9.item-1 { background-color: orange; }\n10.item-2 { background-color: lightblue; }\n11.item-3 { background-color: pink; }"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Browser Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Customize Column Sizes",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Notice the following CSS rule inside the container selector:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "/* Customize column sizes */\ngrid-template-columns: 200px 100px 50px;"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Because we have defined three different width values (200px, 100px, and 50px), the grid will now contain three columns."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You can change the values of grid-template-columns to change the size of each column easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Idea Emoji",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
